description: Never push to remote or merge PRs without explicit user approval
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git Remote Operations Require Approval

Never run any of the following without asking the user first and receiving explicit written confirmation:

- `git push` (any variant)
- `gh pr merge`
- Any command that writes to a remote repository

Always ask: "Ready for me to push/merge?" and wait for a clear "yes" before proceeding.
